			],
			"Message": "style(Grove): Apply consistent blank line formatting across source files\n\nAdd blank lines after struct, enum, and impl block definitions throughout the Grove codebase to establish consistent vertical spacing. This affects API types, VSCode facade, common errors and traits, protocol spine client, configuration service, transport adapter, and integration tests.\n\nThe changes standardize formatting by inserting empty lines between type definitions and their implementations, after field declarations in structs, and around logical code sections. No functional behavior changes — purely aesthetic improvements for readability and code style consistency.",
